  "description": "The Shift S3 29\" is an excellent introduction to full suspension Trail riding. With its 1x transmission, the 29\" Shift S3 offers smooth riding, increased control and faster speed over rocks, roots and bumps thanks to its bigger wheel size. Its X6 alloy frame with tapered head tube and 120mm of travel features a simple and efficient single pivot suspension design, which allows for an easy and low-cost maintenance. The Suntour Raidon XC air fork and rear shock package provides 120mm of travel while the new Shimano Deore 1x drive train with its 11-46T 10-speed cassette is matched to a Suntour Zeron 30T crankset for a wider gearing choice. Last but not least, efficient stopping is provided by a set of new Shimano MT-200 disc brakes complete with 180/160mm rotors.",
